WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.752
I turned around in the dark.

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:05.810
But standing behind me was not a monster.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.920
It was ME from tomorrow, clutching an iron crowbar.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.310
He whispered: The government never dropped a bomb.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:19.550
They tried to burn the rift beneath this mall.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.388
Suddenly, the floor shattered!

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:27.380
Massive purple rift tendrils erupted from below!

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.870
The bunker was collapsing.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.381
He shouted: Head for the maintenance shaft! Close the loop!

00:00:33.531 --> 00:00:37.611
I leaped toward the ladder into the blinding daylight,

00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:42.401
just as he slammed the heavy blast door shut forever.

00:00:42.551 --> 00:00:45.543
I stumbled onto the quiet street above.

00:00:45.543 --> 00:00:47.991
My phone buzzed one last time:

00:00:48.141 --> 00:00:51.632
Timeline secured. You survived.
